<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-28T23:22:54.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:22:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Man Kashmir continued joint reviews by the DGP and GOC of XV Corps, held an anti-fidayeen mock drill in Bandipora and investigated the death of a JCO, while civilian casualties occurred from a dumper accident, a truck crash and a sand-mound collapse. In Manipur the Assam Rifles DG inspected border fencing and joint grids, seized weapons from a Kuki-Zo insurgent camp and the Kuki-Zo Council warned of stronger political measures including withdrawing MLAs. The Naga council organized a mega rally demanding the SoO pact be scrapped. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPXzFfM3hSODF3R2J1OEVsN2VxTXFxR3hsOVNnNERkMVNyNFNrNnJIcWF0RXhQd01UMnJUbHJ4aWx3LVVDWWFERUZJLTNCOGRENmtPRXp3c1BFdWdsQTctYTAxbkp1ejZyWGhpWVJ1MmRYUGNLaG92enNFWXFtUkc3YThEcE8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOdzdjbkxrVzhqY1pEQ3VWUXFPR3dORzlBRmotS2FfR0lzdmJDVmVLTXpqSzRoOXRzVWJmd0lVUU81TF8xRm9acDJ5NXgtMXRrWjk3YmkyVk5QdlB1NlI3b3VBX3BveVRDUFR5OVBRYnR0YUoyNXpHVjJhWnU4QU9nTUZPUERfNzRyVWQtSkJGU21hUUlwM3ZNZTl5WEV2Um9WNnV6LVVnZUhHM0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQenczY3BaRjRGa0w1UnU0VWZzUHpCVFhwNVY1VVVVQXlSaFl1NktRcTBweUZNMDlfY25Zdm05VS1VOFlyNGpzbGV2ek1CVU9ZLUtYNHZKM2F5SzlJQXdUOF9BUWtkbnV3ZnJmdjI2X1hjSXNHc1JPVnI2S2ZJbTJGOXJmV2ExdURvTndn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Independent Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles